OL,3,GNEWSAParents suing over 'rubbish'
OL,4,Achildren's tuition courses
OL,5,
OL,6,FParents are suing a former director of
OL,7,Fa children's tuition company that they
OL,8,Fsay provided outdated and "rubbish"
OL,9,Fvideos and misled them into expensive
OL,10,Floan agreements.
OL,12,FThe group said they had been left
OL,13,F"thousands of pounds out of pocket" by
OL,14,FExemplar Education, a national provider
OL,15,Fof online maths and English tuition
OL,16,Fcourses.
OL,18,FMore than 400,000 children in the UK
OL,19,Fwere understood to have been registered
OL,20,Fwith the firm, which claimed in 2020 to
OL,21,Fbe the UK's largest home learning
OL,22,Fcompany.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
